{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","title":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3715,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:local-nondegenerate-family]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","line":6350,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Extension of a Nondegenerate Family to a Nondegenerate Frame]\n\\label{lem:extend-nondegenerate-family}\n\n\\uses{def:local-nondegenerate-family, lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases, lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent, lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis, lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis, lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple}\n\n\n\n\nLet $g$ be a smooth field of scalar products on a rank-$m$ bundle $V\\to B$. If $X_1,\\ldots,X_k$ are nondegenerate sections on open $u$ and $x_0\\in u$, then $k\\le m$ and, on some $x_0\\in v\\subseteq u$, they extend to nondegenerate sections $Y_1,\\ldots,Y_m$ with $Y_i=X_i$ for $i\\le k$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:local-nondegenerate-family,lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases,lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent,lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis,lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis,lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple}\n\\sketch At $x_0$, use Lemmas \\ref{lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent}, \\ref{lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases}, and \\ref{lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis} to extend the tuple to a basis $(w_j)$. Lemma \\ref{lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis} realizes the extra $w_j$ by local sections; retain the original first $k$ sections and shrink using Lemma \\ref{lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Extension of a Nondegenerate Family to a Nondegenerate Frame] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a657874656e642d6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d66616d696c79\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Alocal-nondegenerate-family\">↗ def:local-nondegenerate-family</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Acompletion-nondegenerate-bases\">↗ lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-tuple-independent\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-tuple-basis\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Asections-through-prescribed-basis\">↗ lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aopen-nondegenerate-tuple\">↗ lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple</a> <p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> be a smooth field of scalar products on a rank-<span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$m$\">$m$</span> bundle <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$V\\to B$\">$V\\to B$</span>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X_1,\\ldots ,X_k$\">$X_1,\\ldots ,X_k$</span> are nondegenerate sections on open <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u$\">$u$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0\\in u$\">$x_0\\in u$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k\\le m$\">$k\\le m$</span> and, on some <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0\\in v\\subseteq u$\">$x_0\\in v\\subseteq u$</span>, they extend to nondegenerate sections <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y_1,\\ldots ,Y_m$\">$Y_1,\\ldots ,Y_m$</span> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Y_i=X_i$\">$Y_i=X_i$</span> for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$i\\le k$\">$i\\le k$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Alocal-nondegenerate-family\">↗ def:local-nondegenerate-family</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Acompletion-nondegenerate-bases\">↗ lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-tuple-independent\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-tuple-basis\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Asections-through-prescribed-basis\">↗ lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aopen-nondegenerate-tuple\">↗ lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple</a> \\sketch At <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0$\">$x_0$</span>, use Lemmas <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-tuple-independent\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d7475706c652d696e646570656e64656e74\">16.3</a>, <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Acompletion-nondegenerate-bases\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a636f6d706c6574696f6e2d6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d6261736573\">4</a>, and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-tuple-basis\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d7475706c652d6261736973\">16.3</a> to extend the tuple to a basis <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(w_j)$\">$(w_j)$</span>. Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Asections-through-prescribed-basis\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a73656374696f6e732d7468726f7567682d707265736372696265642d6261736973\">16.3</a> realizes the extra <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$w_j$\">$w_j$</span> by local sections; retain the original first <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$k$\">$k$</span> sections and shrink using Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aopen-nondegenerate-tuple\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6f70656e2d6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d7475706c65\">16.3</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-riemannian-submanifold-induced-tensor","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-adapted-frame","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:local-nondegenerate-family","title":"def:local-nondegenerate-family","label":"def:local-nondegenerate-family"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases","title":"lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases","label":"lem:completion-nondegenerate-bases"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent","title":"lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent","label":"lem:nondegenerate-tuple-independent"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis","title":"lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis","label":"lem:nondegenerate-tuple-basis"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis","title":"lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis","label":"lem:sections-through-prescribed-basis"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:open-nondegenerate-tupl